# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day36

I remember when I traveled to Busan with my friends.

We were planning to visit several tourist attractions during the day.

The thing is, we missed our train because we arrived at the station too late.

Unfortunately, the next train wasn't available for another two hours.

At first, we were pretty stressed because we had already made a schedule for the day.

So I decided to change our plans and look for something nearby.

Luckily, there was a famous market close to the station.

We went there, had lunch, and walked around for a while.

In the end, we actually had a great time, even though our original plan didn't work out.

It taught me that it's important to stay flexible when traveling.
